"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"958e6e\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"453e34\"},\"title\":\"1.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/d28cf8f5-d088-4ff8-8405-6b105658c92d/1.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"6a74e3e0fd8f5d48ba237a71\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1791577767518,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1786049102013,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"2175bba2-5e53-48d9-b66e-fce5d8fa08bc\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"5.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"010101\",\"topRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020203\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"5b5c52\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"41433c\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-f7lzf-z257w-7knte-f6zjj-nep3s-7jg3g\",\"title\":\"Badlands  - Wednesday 23 September - Coal House Cafe, Woodberry Wetlands, Nr Manor House, London N16\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Badlands</span><br /><span>Directed by </span><strong><span>Terrence Malick</span></strong><br />United States, <span>1973</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Don your double denim, black and white cowboy boots, gingham shirt and headscarves\\u2026 we\\u2019ll be running through reeds \\u2026 Lee Jeans are providing me with some of their amazing 101 Japanese range \\u2026 come in Double Denim and you\\u2019ll get a special gift!</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>A tale of crime and love begins in a dead-end town when teen baton-twirler Holly takes off with older rebel Kit after a conflict with her father erupts In the ensuing crime spree, they journey through the Midwest to the Badlands of Montana, eluding authorities along the way.</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong><em>Badlands</em></strong><span> announced the arrival of a major talent: Terrence Malick. His impressionistic take on the notorious Charles Starkweather killing spree of the late 1950s uses a serial-killer narrative as a springboard for an oblique teenage romance.</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Gates open 7pm</span><br />7pm to 8.15pm  - <span>DJ Martin Green playing a set inspired by the film</span><br /><span>Film at 8.15pm</span><br /><span>Film length 1hr 34mins</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">With iconic music by Carl Orff. Nat King Cole and James Taylor</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Featuring</strong><br /><strong>Martin Sheen</strong><span> and </span><strong>Sissy Spacek</strong><span>.</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">DJ Martin Green before the film playing from the back of Keef - the Rebel Reel Vespacar  (actually not from the back of Keef as it\\u2019s a bit low for Martin to DJ from \\u2026)</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49