body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/08ce264b-b620-4a85-a2dd-fcd4fce80066/Slide2.jpeg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"960x540\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6aada28d51e8655725f9ba06\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1789764237252,\"updatedOn\":1794655840533,\"displayIndex\":15,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a7b4662833301697af123cb\",\"systemDataId\":\"ea4a9522-7019-4014-ab5f-e5e6573e45e9\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"960x540\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Slide3.jpeg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"000000\",\"topRightAverage\":\"000000\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"000000\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"000000\",\"centerAverage\":\"000000\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"2e2d25\"},\"title\":\"Slide3.jpeg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/ea4a9522-7019-4014-ab5f-e5e6573e45e9/Slide3.jpeg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"960x540\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"6a458357bc48640709246f43\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1791577107839,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1782940658661,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"1ab99ba9-129c-456d-9671-5f4721661155\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"3.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"242424\",\"topRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"614f47\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"332e2b\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-knk6j-a7jzz-zywd5\",\"title\":\"VANISHING POINT - Sat 22 August 2026 - Dungeness Beach\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Vanishing Point<br />Dir. <strong><em>Richard C. Sarafian</em></strong><br />1971<br />98 mins</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Why Vanishing Point?</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">It\\u2019s not just a car chase film \\u2026 It inspired an album by Primal Scream \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">And it nods towards American Graffiti or Good Morning Vietnam with an ever present DJ connecting with the other characters \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Much of where it takes place looks like Dungeness too \\u2026 Though it has a deceptively simple structure, there is more going on under the hood. There are subtleties at play that are hard to articulate.<em>Vanishing Point</em>is a reflective sojourn that rises above cliches and Hollywood conventions.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Music from 7.30pm<br />Screening at 8.15pm</p><p style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><em>Kowalski (Barry Newman) is a delivery driver who makes a bet to deliver a Dodge Challenger from Denver to San Francisco in fifteen hours. While dodging the police, he meets an old prospector, a religious commune of singers, and a naked girl on a motorcycle! He becomes something of a cult hero thanks to Super Soul (Cleavon Little), a blind deejay with a seemingly mystical connection to Kowalski.</em></p><p style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><em>Vanishing Point</em>visually captures the ambience of the American road, evoking the spirit of Jack Kerouac. The shots of milling crowds and small-town bystanders seem authentic, almost documentary-like. And it has a distinctly American sound. Except for a recurring, instrumental love theme, the score is primarily made up of rock and folk songs that embody the time. There\\u2019s no confusion as to what decade this film was made in.<em>Vanishing Point</em>has something to say about freedom, disillusionment with authority\\u2013 and racial unrest. The scene depicting an off-duty police officer leading a mob into a black-operated radio station is not far removed from the tenor of our own times.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">This is an outdoor screening on Dungeness Beach by the Snack Shack.<br />Feel free to bring drinks and food.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">This is an outdoor screening on Dungeness Beach by the Snack Shack.<br />Feel free to bring drinks and food.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-knk6j-a7jzz-zywd5\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/1ab99ba9-129c-456d-9671-5f4721661155/3.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\