\"filename\":\"4.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"0d0d0d\",\"topRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"cbbb88\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"554e46\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-knk6j-a7jzz-jkydb\",\"title\":\"ROSE OF NEVADA - Thursday 27 August 2026 - Dungeness Beach\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Rose of Nevada<br />Dir. Mark Jenkin<br />2026<br />1hr 54mins</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Why Rose of Nevada</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">We showed Bait back in 2022 which is another of Cornish Man Mark Jenkin\\u2019s innovative and slightly unsettling films.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Music from 7.30pm<br />Screening at 8.15pm</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong><span>Mark Jenkin's third feature film, shot on 16mm, tells the tale of a boat that mysteriously reappears in a Cornish fishing village after vanishing 30 years ago.</span></strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">This is an outdoor screening on Dungeness Beach by the Snack Shack.<br />Feel free to bring drinks and food.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-knk6j-a7jzz-jkydb\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/7c4362a4-2cf3-4e94-981b-2a4d36ff9d1f/4.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"cu