cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/beaea38b-1be6-43c9-93be-039eab49621b/Dungeness+Beach+May+2026.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"3024x4032\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"6a6b49902850687429bae285\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1791577510951,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1785429798068,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"be1352a1-676a-43e8-83d1-f10964cfbb25\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"1.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"3e3e3e\",\"topRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"010101\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"91674d\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"585653\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-knk6j-a7jzz-zywd5-t8wse\",\"title\":\"The Wicker Man  - Fri 28 August 2026 - Hastings Castle\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">The Wicker Man<br />Dir. Robin Hardy<br />1971<br />98 mins</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">With Maypole Dancing Lessons before! YES \\u2026 your chance to Maypole \\u2026 AND DJ</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">In the woods there grew a tree<br />A fine, fine tree was he</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">On that tree there was a limb<br />And on that limb there was a branch<br />On that branch there was a nest<br />And in that nest there was an egg<br />In that egg there was a bird<br />And from that bird a feather came<br />Of that feather was a bed</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">On that bed there was a girl<br />And on that girl there was a man<br />From that man there was a seed<br />And from that seed there was a boy<br />From that boy there was a man<br />And for that man there was a grave<br />From that grave there grew a tree</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">In Sumerisle, Sumerisle, Sumerisle, Sumerisle, Sumerisle</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">On that tree there was a limb<br />And on that limb there was a branch<br />On that branch there was a nest<br />And in that nest there was an egg<br />In that egg there was a bird<br />And from that bird a feather came<br />Of that feather was a bed</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">In Sumerisle, Sumerisle, Sumerisle, Sumerisle, Sumerisle</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">On that bed there was a girl (Sumerisle, Sumerisle)<br />And on that girl there was a man (Sumerisle, Sumerisle)<br />From that man there was a seed (Sumerisle, Sumerisle)<br />And from that seed there was a boy (Sumerisle, Sumerisle)<br />From that boy there was a man (Sumerisle, Sumerisle)<br />And for that man there was a grave<br />From that grave there grew a tree</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">The Wicker Man is based on a little-known 1967 novel by British actor and author David Pinner called Ritual, whose film rights were purchased in 1971 by Lord Summerilse himself \\u2026Christopher Lee. He <strong>proclaiming it the best film he'd ever made</strong>.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Anthony Shaffer adapted the book and first-time director Robin Hardy directed it. We love the music which has grown in cult status too!</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Shot over a few weeks<a rel=\\\"noopener\\\" href=\\\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070612192345/http:/www.totalfilm.com/features/the_total_film_interview__christopher_lee\\\"> i</a>n the glorious Scottish border region of Galloway, The Wicker Man is a leftfield low-budget film which couldn\\u2019t be better suited to Hastings!</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">DJ, bar, food available from the Pizza place next door (bring it in or bring your own food) and Maypole Dancing from 7.00pm<br />Screening at 8.15pm</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">This is an outdoor screening in Hastings Castle.<br />Food and drink will be available to be purchased next door from the pizza place to help support the conservation of this amazing castle overlooking the channel.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-knk6j-a7jzz-zywd5-t8wse\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/be1352a1-676a-43e8-83d1-f10964cfbb25/1.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Buy Ticket\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":true,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{},\"optionValues\":[],\"id\":\"4794075d-3fd0-4dcb-a7fb-7ce851701cd7\",\"sku\":\"WICKERHASTINGSFULL\",\"price\":2000,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"20.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyIn