",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"888184\"},\"title\":\"Maypole Dancing.jpeg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/973ebcf6-3c02-4f85-9946-69331d798429/Maypole+Dancing.jpeg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1125x2000\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6a6b7f2574d57541d2141d7a\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1785429797004,\"updatedOn\":1785429797004,\"displayIndex\":3,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a6b49902850687429bae285\",\"systemDataId\":\"7ecf3fc3-0590-4a23-841f-59cb1718d7ea\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"2048x1365\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Maypole Dancing from above inside.jpeg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"6d462a\",\"topRightAverage\":\"322419\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"70503e\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"47321f\",\"centerAverage\":\"8e512c\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"77553d\"},\"title\":\"Maypole Dancing from above inside.jpeg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/7ecf3fc3-0590-4a23-841f-59cb1718d7ea/Maypole+Dancing+from+above+inside.jpeg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"2048x1365\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6a6b7f2574d57541d2141d7c\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1785429797052,\"updatedOn\":1785429797052,\"displayIndex\":4,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a6b49902850687429bae285\",\"systemDataId\":\"6f85a062-4793-41a0-a9fa-8febc47e4557\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"200x200\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Hastings May Queen Dancers.jpeg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"f5f5f5\",\"topRightAverage\":\"f7f7f7\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"f8f8f8\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"f7f7f7\",\"centerAverage\":\"7e7e7e\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"bdbdbd\"},\"title\":\"Hastings May Queen Dancers.jpeg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/6f85a062-4793-41a0-a9fa-8febc47e4557/Hastings+May+Queen+Dancers.jpeg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"200x200\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6a6b7f25ee0be1675478ec33\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1785429797011,\"updatedOn\":1785429797011,\"displayIndex\":5,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a6b49902850687429bae285\",\"systemDataId\":\"850b3a66-3c4d-403b-9c5d-f45b825b485d\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"130x95\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"download copy.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"fefefe\",\"topRightAverage\":\"ddd3d0\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"743e30\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"aba099\",\"centerAverage\":\"f1e7e4\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"b3938b\"},\"title\":\"download copy.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/850b3a66-3c4d-403b-9c5d-f45b825b485d/download+copy.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"130x95\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"6a63dfdbc6646628030f4777\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1788249178798,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1784969720439,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"013025bd-b053-4bb0-80c8-2b1e61b835e5\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Dungeness 2026-6.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"010101\",\"topRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020203\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"ea5f3f\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"57453a\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-f7lzf-z257w-7knte-f6zjj-nep3s\",\"title\":\"PAST EVENT La Piscine (The Swimming Pool)  - Wednesday 5 August- Coal House Cafe, Woodberry Wetlands, Nr Manor House, London N16\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Following the success of Deep End and The Swimmer we\\u2019re (finally) showing La Piscine - (the English language version - voiced by the bilingual actors) \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">On Wednesday 5th August we\\u2019re returning to Woodberry Wetlands \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">And if you love design you\\u2019re going to love this \\u2026<span>Courr\\u00E9ges designed items including bikinis for this, brionvega radios abound \\u2026<br />there is an orgy of design furniture including Locus Solus Garden Furniture by Gae Aulenti for Poltronova, Roger Tallon Module 400 seating, amazing inflatable side tables and so much more \\u2026</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">BUT it\\u2019s Alain Delon and Romy Schneider who star with Jane Birkin.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">It\\u2019s another one with an amazing soundtrack too \\u2026 Jane literally pressing the button to put the needle on the record \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">La Piscine<br />1969 Dir, Jacques Deray<br />2hrs 3mins</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">A m\\u00E9nage \\u00E0 trois stirs passion and jealousy beside a secluded pool in this sultry, French cult-thriller.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Lovers Marianne and Jean-Paul take a lazy vacation beside a Hockney-esque sun-splashed swimming pool in St. Tropez. But then Marianne\\u2019s ex suddenly drops by with his daughter and a former m\\u00E9nage \\u00E0 trois becomes a m\\u00E9nage \\u00E0 quatre, and tension sets in in the heat of the Southern French.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">With music by Michel Legrand, a screenplay by Jean-Claude Carri\\u00E8re and Deray, and some of the best design, this is a sensual, slow-burning cult thriller.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Featuring</strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><a href=\\\"https://player.bfi.org.uk/search/subscription?q=Alain%20Delon&amp;availability=1\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Alain Delon</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://player.bfi.org.uk/search/subscription?q=Romy%20Schneider&amp;availability=1\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Romy Schneider</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://player.bfi.org.uk/search/subscription?q=Maurice%20Ronet&amp;availability=1\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Maurice Ronet</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://player.bfi.org.uk/search/subscription?q=Jane%20Birkin&amp;availability=1\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Jane Birkin</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://player.bfi.org.uk/search/subscription?q=Paul%20Crauchet&amp;availability=1\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Paul Crauchet</a></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Sc<a href=\\\"https://filmandfurniture.com/film/la-piscine-the-swimming-pool/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">r</a>eening at 8.30pm, gates open for drinks and food from 7.00pm</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">DJ before the film playing from the back of Keef - the Rebel Reel Vespacar </p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-f7lzf-z257w-7knte-f6zjj-nep3s\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/013025bd-b053-4bb0-80c8-2b1e61b835e5/Dungeness+2026-6.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"e96cae9e-ce30-4e26-8997-69cc753a27a0\",\"sku\":\"LAPISCINE\",\"price\":1500,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"15.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\