4471af187139/IMG_4967.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1169x1183\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6a74f5178d7a8a3a2917f355\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1786049815846,\"updatedOn\":1786049815846,\"displayIndex\":10,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a63dfdbc6646628030f4777\",\"systemDataId\":\"b6d21b0b-924f-443a-93cb-46ea092d3bcc\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1170x1168\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"IMG_4966.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"b4c1e4\",\"topRightAverage\":\"cad6f6\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"000003\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"000101\",\"centerAverage\":\"5e5d61\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"36353b\"},\"title\":\"IMG_4966.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/b6d21b0b-924f-443a-93cb-46ea092d3bcc/IMG_4966.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1170x1168\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"6a3854d8a651515025abc435\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1788231804556,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\",\"Withnail and I\",\"Richardegrant\",\"Paul Smith\",\"Doesn'texistmagazine\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1782079511119,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"2430cd09-24ca-4966-9b18-57c46e97caf6\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"HAROLD AND MAUDE, WITHNAIL AND I-3.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"c3b75e\",\"topRightAverage\":\"a37e5a\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"a99379\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"9f826a\",\"centerAverage\":\"cf7ae6\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"c2b3b1\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk-ryyya-s5rd4-ckl8p-snhar-cw94n-kwahe\",\"title\":\"Wiithnail and I - Thursday 23 July 2026 6.30pm - Paul Smith. Albermarle Street, Mayfair\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">A very special intimate screening in Paul\\u2019s Smith beautiful store in Albermarle Street in Mayfair</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Ticket includes:<br />Screening of the film<br />Drink and canapes courtesy of Paul Smith<br />Photographic Print display of Murray Close\\u2019s behind the scenes photographs<br />Your own copy of incredible art book/ film magazine Doesn\\u2019t Exist (rrp \\u00A319)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Withnail and I</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">London. The 1960s. Two unemployed actors\\u2014acerbic, elegantly wasted (and oh so stylish \\u2026)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Danny: \\u201CHas he just been busted?\\u201D </span><br />Marwood: \\u201CNo.\\u201D <br />Danny: \\u201CThen why's he wearing that old suit?\\u201D<br />Withnail: \\u201COld suit! This suit was cut by Hawke's of Savile Row.&nbsp;Just because the best tailoring you've ever seen is above your fucking appendix doesn't mean anything.\\u201C</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Withnail (Richard E. Grant) and the anxiety-ridden \\\"I\\\" (Paul McGann)\\u2014drown their frustrations in booze, pills, and lighter fluid.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">We\\u2019ll be showing Murray Close\\u2019s iconic behind the scenes photographs with a physical display of some of the Murray\\u2019s prints (Oh, and you might just get a postcard from Murray too!)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Paul Smith has a direct link with Withnail which we\\u2019ll tell you about on the night \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Withnail and I is suitably stylish film from designer Andrea Galer\\u2019s iconic coat - which we\\u2019ll have an example of for you to look at at the sceening (Andrea was the wardrobe assistant on Hail The New Puritan which we showed at All is Joy last year) to Marwood\\u2019s boiled wool jumper, leather coat and matinee idol fedora the costumes are as piss elegant (in an aristocratically moth eaten way) as Withnail and Marwood are pissed \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">When Withnail's Uncle Monty (Richard Griffiths) offers his cottage, they escape the squalor of their flat for a week in the country. They soon realize they\\u2019ve gone on holiday by mistake when their wits\\u2014and friendship\\u2014are sorely tested by violent downpours, less than hospitable locals, and empty cupboards. An intelligent, superbly acted, and hilarious film, Bruce Robinson\\u2019s semi-autobiographical cult favourite is laugh out loud funny\\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">7pm: DOORS - DJ</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">7.30pm: Introduction with Chris McGill (Rebel Reel Cine Club)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">8pm: Withnail and I</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Withnail and I</strong><br />Dir. Bruce Robinson 1987<br />1hr 47 mins<br />RIchard E Grant, Paul McGann </p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Following a chance meeting with Paul Smith in the street we\\u2019re screening in Paul\\u2019s amazing store in Albermarle Street.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"></p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk-ryyya-s5rd4-ckl8p-snhar-cw94n-kwahe\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/2430cd09-24ca-4966-9b18-57c46e97caf6/HAROLD+AND+MAUDE%2C+WITHNAIL+AND+I-3.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"2a5071c3-2562-449c-af7c-2d1dfb3c5f6c\",\"sku\":\"PAULSMITH\",\"price\":2900,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"29.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[{\"productId\":\"64da96871f464f78ba802c25\",\"variantIds\":[\"3901fead-27fb-436f-8454-728d048bd1cc\"]}]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"curre