pg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/5108b710-d49c-4cef-912f-3894d54b4d7b/DoestexistWheat.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"3024x4032\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6a386016bbaef61d5bb4fe0d\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1782079510056,\"updatedOn\":1782079510056,\"displayIndex\":17,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a3854d8a651515025abc435\",\"systemDataId\":\"d329305e-9f27-4c7e-b212-ec7c138bcd86\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"4032x3024,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Furniture.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"a79f94\",\"topRightAverage\":\"756556\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"988776\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"3f362e\",\"centerAverage\":\"928e88\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"807566\"},\"title\":\"Furniture.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/d329305e-9f27-4c7e-b212-ec7c138bcd86/Furniture.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"4032x3024\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"seoData\":{\"seoTitle\":\"Withnail and I in Paul Smith's Albermarle St Store\",\"seoHidden\":false},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"6a38ea6c6a46d849d1c924cf\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1788231987785,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\",\"Harold and Maude\",\"Hal Ashby\",\"Cat Stevens\",\"Bud Cort\",\"Ruth Gordon\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1782121689156,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"66165cc3-8488-4814-b260-f3a64e03a6e9\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"HAROLD AND MAUDE, WITHNAIL AND I-2.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"080808\",\"topRightAverage\":\"010202\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"433b33\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"4c4133\"},\"urlId\":\"haroldandmaudemildmay\",\"title\":\"Harold and Maude - Friday 31st July 2026 7pm  - Mildmay Club\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Rebel Reel Cine Club at Mildmay Club, Stoke Newington Green</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Harold and Maude</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Dir. Hal Ashby</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Doors 7pm</strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Music from Martin Green on decks from 7pm and 7 Inch Max after the film until midnight </strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Main Feature 8.00pm</strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">A huge inspiration for Wes Anderson (Rushmore) and one of the most cult classics - made in 1971 (it didn\\u2019t turn a profit until 1983 BUT has played almost continuously in France since its release).</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">One of Rebel Reel Cine Club\\u2019s favourite films \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Funerals, suicide references, comedy, living life for the moment - one of the most uplifting (non) Hollywood films ever made from the director of Being Theatre and Shampoo.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">The plot revolves around the exploits of a young man in his early 20s named Harold Chasen (<a href=\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bud_Cort\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><u><span>Bud Cort</span></u></a>) who is intrigued with death. Harold drifts away from the life that his detached mother (<a href=\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vivian_Pickles\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><u><span>Vivian Pickles</span></u></a>) prescribes for him, and slowly develops a strong friendship, and eventually a romantic relationship, with a 79-year-old woman named Maude (<a href=\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruth_Gordon\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><u><span>Ruth Gordon</span></u></a>), a Nazi concentration camp survivor who teaches Harold about the importance of living life to its fullest and that life is the most precious gift of all.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Please note this has an age certificate of 15.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/haroldandmaudemildmay\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/66165cc3-8488-4814-b260-f3a64e03a6e9/HAROLD+AND+MAUDE%2C+WITHNAIL+AND+I-2.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"e3be40b7-20d5-46a6-8d1f-37a3c56bfed7\",\"sku\":\"MILDMAYH&M\",\"price\":1500,\"salePrice\":1000,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"15.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"10.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"relatedProductsStrategy\":\"off\",\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"e3be40b7-20d5-46a6-8d1f-37a3c56bfed7\",\"sku\":\"MILDMAYH&M\",\"price\":1500,\"salePrice\":1000,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"15.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"10.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"relatedProductsStrategy\":\"off\",\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false,\"items\":[{\"id\":\"6a3904d81cb9997c2b692531\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1782121688504,\"updatedOn\":1782121688504,\"displayIndex\":0,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a38ea6c6a46d849d1c924cf\",\"systemDataId\":\"66165cc3-8488-4814-b260-f3a64e03a6e9\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"HAROLD AND MAUDE, WITHNAIL AND I-2.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"080808\",\"topRightAverage\":\"010202\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"433b33\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"4c4133\"},\"title\":\"HAROLD AND MAUDE, WITHNAIL AND I-2.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/66165cc3-8488-4814-b260-f3a64e03a6e9/HAROLD+AND+MAUDE%2C+WITHNAIL+AND+I-2.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6a3904d81cb9997c2b692532\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1782121688520,\"updatedOn\":1782121688520,\"displayIndex\":1,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a38ea6c6a46d849d1c924cf\",\"systemDataId\":\"015b331d-072f-4cfb-8024-802633fce8d7\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"3302x3413,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"20260221-4A8A4022.JPG\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"1f1f1f\",\"topRightAverage\":\"0d0d0d\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"040404\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"040404\",\"centerAverage\":\"cdcdcd\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"222222\"},\"title\":\"20260221-4A8A4022.JPG\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/015b331d-072f-4cfb-8024-802633fce8d7/20260221-4A8A4022.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"3302x3413\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6a3904d835c3b7335881bc95\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1782121688531,\"updatedOn\":1782121688531,\"displayIndex\":2,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6a38ea6c6a46d849d1c924cf\",\"systemDataId\":\"1cd9a6ff-7065-4c51-af07-ce10a19d1508\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"823x540,100w,300w,500w,750w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Slide2.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"4b3230\",\"topRightAverage\":\"2d292b\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"151021\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"8b6b3f\",\"centerAverage\":\"aa7b52\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"534039\"},\"title\":\"Slide2.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/1cd9a6ff-7065-4c51-af07-ce10a19d1508/Slide2.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"823x540\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"seoData\":{\"seoHidden\":false},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"698d04a8d435ff039ba3f2cb\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1788159238494,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1770849969387,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"3ba472af-d9ef-4223-bab7-90918d79ab32\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Phantom of the paradise-5.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"313131\",\"topRightAverage\":\"a0a0a1\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"000000\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"321d1d\",\"centerAverage\":\"a1a4b7\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"695e60\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-knk6j\",\"title\":\"ZABRISKIE POINT - Fri 22nd May 2026 - Dungeness Beach\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Zabriskie Point<br />Dir. Michelangelo Antonioni<br />1970<br />112 mins</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Why Zabriskie Point?</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">We love Antonioni and Zabriski Point is filmed in Death Valley and the stunning scenery and Counterculture soundtrack will play with the Dungeness deserts scape in the background perfectly \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Music from 7pm<br />Screening at 8.15pm </p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Zabriskie Point \\u2013 Antonioni\\u2019s counterculture headtrip of a film - review by Peter </strong><span>Bradshaw</span><strong> in Guardian 2014</strong><span><br />At all times freaky and far-out, Michelangelo Antonioni\\u2019s fascinating and under-appreciated 1970 film Zabriskie Point is now on re-release. Mocked and critically patronised at the time, this was a counterculture adventure with something in common with Easy Rider and Bonnie and Clyde. It was a midwife to the desert reveries of David Lynch, and provided an acid flashback to Hitchcock\\u2019s North by Northwest. Short of travelling by time machine, watching this film is the best way to visit the Los Angeles of the late 1960s, with all the streetscapes, billboards and brand names. Zabriskie Point created its own docu-surrealism by casting non-professional unknowns and meshing real campus-unrest footage with experimental waywardness. It is superior, in my heretical view, to his 1966 film </span><a href=\\\"https://www.theguardian.com/film/filmblog/2011/nov/23/my-favourite-film-blow-up\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Blowup<span>. Mark</span></a><span> Frechette plays an armed student radical on the run from police. Stealing a small plane, he lights out for the stark beauty of Death Valley, where he meets Daria (Daria Halprin), a hippie chick with whom he has a sexual epiphany, psychodramatised as an orgy. Daria is having an affair with Lee (Rod Taylor), a corporate real-estate exec, whose company, Daria belatedly grasps, is despoiling the desert with its bourgeois developments. What follows is not a bonfire but a slo-mo detonation of the vanities. Antonioni\\u2019s head trip of a film is very pleasurable.</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">This is an outdoor screening on Dungeness Beach by the Snack Shack.<br />Feel free to bring drinks and food. <br />The Pizza Van will be available to pre-order.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-knk6j\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/3ba472af-d9ef-4223-bab7-90918d79ab32/Phantom+of+the+paradise-5.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"77ed1770-cf06-449b-aba3-d8c7c1da1d6b\",\"sku\":\"POINT\",\"price\":1200,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"12.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"mainImageId\":\"698d04a8d43