"},{\"id\":\"69d79fa16892561c57b5f709\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1775738785092,\"updatedOn\":1782076633243,\"displayIndex\":25,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"69bd02ce33b7493784ce2b1e\",\"systemDataId\":\"351006a5-f770-4cfc-8171-baa421be68e8\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"2.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"080808\",\"topRightAverage\":\"120f0b\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"6d6767\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"2f2828\"},\"title\":\"2.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/351006a5-f770-4cfc-8171-baa421be68e8/2.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"69d79fa14d15e019629a4de0\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1775738785052,\"updatedOn\":1782076633250,\"displayIndex\":26,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"69bd02ce33b7493784ce2b1e\",\"systemDataId\":\"3610aa75-7524-42ab-bbe0-819f487fe1bc\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"1.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"080808\",\"topRightAverage\":\"120f0b\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"a68564\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"4f4746\"},\"title\":\"1.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/3610aa75-7524-42ab-bbe0-819f487fe1bc/1.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"seoData\":{\"seoTitle\":\"Broken English Film Screening, Marianne Faithfull, Iain and Jane\",\"seoHidden\":false},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"697cd364a6919a1404f05430\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1788151363199,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\",\"Faye Dunaway\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1769789057966,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"6a70d67e-9607-48f5-859d-cd78576b93cf\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Phantom of the paradise-3.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"080808\",\"topRightAverage\":\"120404\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020402\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"centerAverage\":\"4d281d\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"392423\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk-ryyya-s5rd4-ckl8p-snhar\",\"title\":\"THE DRIVERS SEAT - Wednesday 4 March 2026  7pm - QT Bar at Middle Eight Screening Room\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Why The Driver\\u2019s Seat?<br />I read Muriel Sparks novella of The Driver\\u2019s Seat (having read The Ballard of Peckham Rye\\u2026), all of Sparks books are pretty transgressive \\u2026 this one is billed as a metaphysical shocker \\u2026<br />Elizabeth Taylor is a kind of dowdy crazed technicolor dressed loon in this (if you\\u2019re being unkind). Her character is genuinely unhinged  and it\\u2019s shot beautifully both inside and out with all kinds of mid-century modern furniture - there\\u2019s a pile of coloured chairs in one scene that is like a sculpture.<br />There is a scene in a department store which has so many uncomfortable silences in it.<br />The whole film is set to an incredible soundtrack and it\\u2019s a kind of detective novel on film - in Italy it was called Identikit which is totally fitting as it pieces together the parts of the leading characters life.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Doors 6.30pm</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">DJ 6.30pm to 7.30pm</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">FIlm 7.30pm Introduction with Chris McGill (Rebel Reel Cine Club)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">7.45pm: The Drivers Seat</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">DJ Issey Carts before and after the film until Midnight </p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">We\\u2019ll show Greer Lankton\\u2019s amazing images from Magic Hour\\u2019s new book - <strong>Greer Lankton\\u2019s iconic and startling doll sculptures as we have never seen them before: through her own eyes.</strong><br />Magic Hour Press is proud to present the first monograph on the trans visionary artist Greer Lankton (1958\\u201396), whose lifelike doll sculptures shocked 1980s New York. Lankton\\u2019s dolls, which she began making as a child and produced obsessively until her death at age 38, were a means to explore her fraught relationship with the human body. In the book\\u2019s 100 photographs, all shot by Lankton herself, these figures take on a life of their own, kvetching at a party, strolling along a beach, or lounging on a stoop in the East Village. Among this extraordinary cast of oddballs\\u2014usually femme, often freakish, alwaysradiating a glamorous confidence\\u2014we find characters of Lankton\\u2019s own invention alongside well-known icons such as Divine, CocoChanel, Andy Warhol and even Lankton herself.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>The Driver\\u2019s Seat </strong><br />Dir. Giuseppe Patroni Griffi<br />1974<br />Elizabeth Taylor, Andy Warhol<br />1hr 47 mins</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">QT at Middle Eight is a screening room is a luxurious space under the hotel at 69 Great Queen Street directly across from the site of the original Blitz Club.  Between Covent Garden and Holborn in <strong>WC2B</strong></p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk-ryyya-s5rd4-ckl8p-snhar\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/6a70d67e-9607-48f5-859d-cd78576b93cf/Phantom+of+the+paradise-3.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"972ae6d7-dae7-4130-bc80-07de26076d61\",\"sku\":\"SQ8581748\",\"price\":1500,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"15.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isS