verage\":\"212228\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"302e42\"},\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/61c679a9-10bc-49cf-b285-4c02adbb499f/Cinema+-+1.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"5760x3840\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"68dab727e6715c1b2b6355fb\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1741883210917,\"updatedOn\":1741883210917,\"displayIndex\":3,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"68dab727e6715c1b2b6355f3\",\"systemDataId\":\"42bcb234-6759-4551-94fb-b4982e957714\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"5760x3840,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Cinema - 2.JPG\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"100c13\",\"topRightAverage\":\"0f0d11\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"282731\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"353248\",\"centerAverage\":\"403647\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"363147\"},\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/42bcb234-6759-4551-94fb-b4982e957714/Cinema+-+2.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"5760x3840\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"68e5f841531a534c88ca95eb\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1788091485808,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\",\"Faye Dunaway\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1759901883222,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"ed04c028-f81f-4301-83af-9c4a63c354c3\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"CINE STYLE 20-3.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"4a4a4a\",\"topRightAverage\":\"303236\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"555555\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"534838\",\"centerAverage\":\"1f7250\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"243a2b\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk-ryyya-s5rd4-ckl8p-n9jm3\",\"title\":\"FALLEN ANGELS - Sun 19 Oct 2025  4pm - All is Joy  Soho\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">As part of Cine Style the iconic Fallen at All is Joy</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Released a year after Wong Kar Wai\\u2019s beloved film </span><em>Chungking Express</em><span>, </span><em>Fallen Angels </em><span>has the same energy and another brilliant soundtrack featuring Massive Attack, Marianne Faithful, Laurie Anderson and an amazing version of Only You!</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Wong Kar Wei\\u2019s direction and Christopher Doyle\\u2019s signature up close and then dreamy but super stylising cinematography lend their films a slick pop video stylised feel (this is by no means an insult \\u2026 the stories themselves always feature such complete engaging characters) </span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">4pm: DOORS - DJ</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">4.30pm: Introduction with Chris McGill (Rebel Reel Cine Club)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">4.45pm: Fallen Angels</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">DJ until 8pm</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Fallen Angels</strong><br />Dir. Wong Kar Wei 1995<br />1hr 33 mins</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Why not buy a Cine Style 2025 pass for 2 or more films.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Save when you buy - this allows you to come to any of the films - please message us to confirm which films you\\u2019d like to come to.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">CINE STYLE 2025</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Presented by Rebel Reel Cine Club with Vadim Kosmos&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>All Is Joy Soho, &nbsp;75 Dean St, London W1D 3PU&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Wednesday 15 October 7pm<br /><span>The Eyes of Laura Mars</span></strong> Dir. Irving Kershner 1978 1hr 44 mins<strong><span><br />DJ Sonia Shadid (Hot Pants Nights)</span></strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Friday 17 October 7pm </strong><br /><strong><span>Querelle </span></strong>Dir. Rainer Fassbender 1982 1hr 47 mins<br />DJ before and after</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Sunday 19 October 4pm<br /><strong><span>Fallen Angels</span></strong> Dir. Wong Kar Wei 1995 1hr 33 mins<br />Before and after</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">All Is Joy is a private members bar and events space, signing up will get you a temporary membership for this screening as well as your permanent membership of Rebel Reel Cine Club which comes with your ticket.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk-ryyya-s5rd4-ckl8p-n9jm3\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/ed04c028-f81f-4301-83af-9c4a63c354c3/CINE+STYLE+20-3.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"9147adc6-eb47-4949-8b5d-b5e4c1af9b5c\",\"sku\":\"FALLENANGELS\",\"price\":1000,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"10.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"9147adc6-eb47-4949-8b5d-b5e4c1af9b5c\",\"sku\":\"FALLENANGELS\",\"price\":1000,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"10.00\"},\"salePr