6-Edit.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"0b0b0b\",\"topRightAverage\":\"191919\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"0f0f0f\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"343434\",\"centerAverage\":\"585858\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"424242\"},\"title\":\"WI_566-Edit.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/25fa9e06-c07e-4adb-bdc8-5882d11a612b/WI_566-Edit.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"5615x3703\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"68da5957b07f5411ead70c1c\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1748985251100,\"updatedOn\":1748985251100,\"displayIndex\":11,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"68da5957b07f5411ead70c17\",\"systemDataId\":\"f1caeff9-7529-43fb-832f-cd3a470a7147\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"RRCC Alfa Cinema.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"050505\",\"topRightAverage\":\"020202\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"1d1d1d\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"161616\",\"centerAverage\":\"505050\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"383838\"},\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/f1caeff9-7529-43fb-832f-cd3a470a7147/RRCC+Alfa+Cinema.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"68da50fb777e1543fccc249a\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1788087148333,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\",\"Faye Dunaway\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1759138569309,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"49690200-9bfa-4e04-bee4-070d373e0969\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"3.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"424242\",\"topRightAverage\":\"414141\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"3c3125\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"2e2e2e\",\"centerAverage\":\"574b49\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"463b37\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk-ryyya\",\"title\":\"THE EYES OF LAURA MARS - Weds 15 Oct 2025  7pm - All is Joy Soho\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">As part of Cine Style the iconic The Eyes of Laura Mars at All is Joy </p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>A photographer who can see through the eyes of a killer.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Starring Faye Dunaway and Tommy Lee Jones. This has a killer soundtrack and the outfits are as smooth as Halston designed Ultra Suede. Quentin Tarrantino said that the </span>photography shoots capture the energy and organised chaotic energy of a Annie Leibovitz shoot. Photographers too love this film.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">It\\u2019s a thriller with one of the greatest twists </p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Sonia Shahid from Hot Pants Nights DJing</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">7pm: DOORS - DJ</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">7.30pm: Introduction with Chris McGill (Rebel Reel Cine Club)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">8pm: The Eyes of Laura Mars</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">9.44pm DJ until Midnight</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>The Eyes of Laura Mars</strong><br />Dir. Irving Kershner 1978<br />1hr 44 mins</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">All Is Joy is a private members bar and events space, signing up will get you a temporary membership for this screening as well as your permanent membership of Rebel Reel Cine Club which comes with your ticket.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk-ryyya\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/49690200-9bfa-4e04-bee4-070d373e0969/3.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"fc9e6afe-310b-4702-8b1c-a38badd87078\",\"sku\":\"LAURA AIJ\",\"price\":1000,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"10.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyI