1,\"updatedOn\":1788089235841,\"displayIndex\":103,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1759491724953,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"c656ca0a-6d42-484b-b06f-f8296368d1a1\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Cine Style Square.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"dda050\",\"topRightAverage\":\"dda050\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"dda050\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"dda050\",\"centerAverage\":\"c9c9ca\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"b08550\"},\"urlId\":\"cine-style-2025-pass-limited-to-20-passes\",\"title\":\"Cine Style 2025 Pass - limited to 20 passes\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Buy a Cine Style 2025 pass for 2 or more films.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Save when you buy - this allows you to come to any of the films - please message us to confirm which films you\\u2019d like to come to.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">CINE STYLE 2025</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Presented by Rebel Reel Cine Club with Vadim Kosmos&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>The Old Ivy House, <span>166 Goswell Rd, London EC1V 7DT</span></strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Monday 13th October 7pm<br /><strong>Saturday Night Fever</strong> Dir. John Badham 1977 1hr 59mins<br />DJ Vadim Kosmos<br /><br /><strong>All Is Joy Soho, &nbsp;75 Dean St, London W1D 3PU&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Tuesday 14 October 7pm<br />Withnail and I</strong> Dir. Bruce Robinson 1987 1hr 47 mins<br />DJ Martin Green and Vadim Kosmos</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Wednesday 15 October 7pm<br /><span>The Eyes of Laura Mars</span></strong> Dir. Irving Kershner 1978 1hr 44 mins<strong><span><br />DJ Sonia Shadid (Hot Pants Nights)</span></strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Friday 17 October 7pm <br /><strong><span>Querelle </span></strong>Dir. Rainer Fassbender 1982 1hr 47 mins<br />DJ before and after</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Sunday 19 October 4pm<br /><strong><span>Fallen Angels</span></strong> Dir. Wong Kar Wei 1995 1hr 33 mins<br />Before and after</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/cine-style-2025-pass-limited-to-20-passes\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/c656ca0a-6d42-484b-b06f-f8296368d1a1/Cine+Style+Square.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add To Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{},\"optionValues\":[],\"id\":\"8752ffee-14f7-49dc-b93a-6e6b4b3c6ae9\",\"sku\":\"CINESTYLEPASS\",\"price\":2000,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"20.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add To Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{},\"optionValues\":[],\"id\":\"8752ffee-14f7-49dc-b93a-6e6b4b3c6ae9\",\"sku\":\"CINESTYLEPASS\",\"price\":2000,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"20.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false,\"items\":[{\"id\":\"68dfb68bf9144c303141d66e\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1759491723999,\"updatedOn\":1759491723999,\"displayIndex\":0,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"68dfb571a7ac865209b6dfd9\",\"systemDataId\":\"c656ca0a-6d42-484b-b06f-f8296368d1a1\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Cine Style Square.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"dda050\",\"topRightAverage\":\"dda050\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"dda050\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"dda050\",\"centerAverage\":\"c9c9ca\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"b08550\"},\"title\":\"Cine Style Square.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/c656ca0a-6d42-484b-b06f-f8296368d1a1/Cine+Style+Square.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"686af8cca03970427254991e\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1788010948056,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1751841969474,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"8b97e939-db1a-4ed9-bee0-c27065d80859\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"3.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"4f4f4f\",\"topRightAverage\":\"5c5426\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"282019\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"262314\",\"centerAverage\":\"543a27\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"4e3f2c\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk\",\"title\":\"BELLE DE JOUR - Friday 12th September from 7pm - All is Joy, 75 Dean Street, Soho\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\">To kick off the Rebel Reel Cine Club Cine Style season we\\u2019ve got Luis Brunel\\u2019s stylistically sharp Belle du Jour with costumes by Yves Saint Laurent</p><p class=\\\"\\\">Why Belle de Jour?</p><p class=\\\"\\\">Luis Brunel\\u2019s classic has some of the best costumes and colouring in film \\u2026 to see it on the big screen will be a Severine style dream \\u2026 \\u201Cwhat you thinking of Severine?\\u201D as her husband keeps asking \\u2026</p><p class=\\\"\\\">We\\u2019ll be taking a deep dive into all things restrained/ restricted/ harnessed and more before the film with fetish model Sweet Severine who\\u2019s a big fan of Catherine Deneuve\\u2019s wardrobe from Yves Saint Laurent in the film.</p><p class=\\\"\\\">We\\u2019ll be looking at the view from 1967 and how Brunel turns what was considered to be a terrible novel into a masterpiece of sixties cinema\\u2026</p><p class=\\\"\\\">What\\u2019s more Karis O\\u2019Hara is playing a special set before and after the film.</p><p class=\\\"\\\">7pm: DOORS - DJ Karis O\\u2019Hara</p><p class=\\\"\\\">7.30pm: Introduction with Sweet Severine (Fetish artist and model ) and Chris McGill (Rebel Reel Cine Club)</p><p class=\\\"\\\">8pm: Belle de Jour</p><p class=\\\"\\\">9.35pm DJ until Midnight</p><p class=\\\"\\\"><strong>Belle de Jour</strong><br>Dir. Luis Brunel 1967 <br>1hr 44 mins</p><p class=\\\"\\\"><strong><em>Luis Bu\\u00F1uel's elegantly surreal film</em></strong> about a bored housewife and part-time sex worker offers a shrewd, scabrous commentary on social and gender relations.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt-sl3pk\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/8b97e939-db1a-4ed9-bee0-c27065d80859/3.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"0782f39e-79bb-449e-89c9-7624e899ca3c\",\"sku\":\"BELLE\",\"price\":1850,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"18.50\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrderin