9539782,\"displayIndex\":6,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"686af8cca03970427254991e\",\"systemDataId\":\"3c1df0a1-cc77-4b29-a16b-a04196224a37\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"5.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"4f4f4f\",\"topRightAverage\":\"5c5426\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"282019\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"242111\",\"centerAverage\":\"442a1b\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"393226\"},\"title\":\"5.jpg\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/3c1df0a1-cc77-4b29-a16b-a04196224a37/5.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"67e0699747f9a570406965ba\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1787965183041,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1742760774549,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"c8cce931-4e3b-4d02-ac47-565ed5b67311\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"3.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"575757\",\"topRightAverage\":\"5e5624\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"1d1d1d\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"3f2e1a\",\"centerAverage\":\"662829\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"412d25\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-f7lzf-2wlpc-maytx-3kbmx-9en4r\",\"title\":\"Blade Runner Beach Screening\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<h4 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>BLADE RUNNER</strong><br><strong>Dir. Ridley Scott  1982</strong><br><span>United Kingdom</span></h4><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Sunday 25 August  2025 - Kelly's Snack Shack, Dungeness Beach</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Is the looming lights of the Nuclear Power Station at Dungeness the perfect setting for the theatrical cut of Ridley Scott\\u2019s classic? Ridley Scott was said to be inspired by the fiery skyline of Industrial Middlesbrough \\u2026 - we\\u2019re showing this in part to celebrate </span><a href=\\\"https://wendycarrig.blog/2025/03/10/save-the-date-the-woman-who-fell-to-earth-photography-exhibition/\\\"><u><span>Wendy Carrig</span></u></a><u><span> exhibition\\u2019s </span></u><span>The Woman Who Fell to Earth which takes place at Jam On The Marsh from 3 - 13 July.</span><br><a href=\\\"https://wendycarrig.blog/2025/03/10/save-the-date-the-woman-who-fell-to-earth-photography-exhibition/\\\">Philip K. Di</a>ck\\u2019s dystopian <em>Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?</em> takes place in a neo-noir LA. Blade runner Rick Deckard wanders the urban slums lit by neon propoganda hunting down replicants that have assumed human likeness. Meanwhile the rest of humanity looks for haven in off-world colonies.</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Music before screening from 7.30pm</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Main film at 8.30pm</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">This is an outdoor screening on the Beach at Dungeness by the Snack Shack</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\