,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/58c25142-22f2-4e05-865d-6a8a1d8413c4/deep-end_db65b10e.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"2244x1783\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"685594e049e5547b0adb8306\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1787999999851,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1750439873107,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"521b3247-42f4-427f-a488-036086d82c1b\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"1.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"4e4e4e\",\"topRightAverage\":\"575022\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"24210f\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"262311\",\"centerAverage\":\"181e1c\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"353c3a\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-f7lzf-z257w-7knte-aj3p6-8h2wy\",\"title\":\"Stand By Me Lake Screening Ticket\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Stand By Me</span><br>Dir. Rob Reiner 1986<br>Certificate 15 </p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Saturday 26 July 2025</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">7.30pm - Vinyl DJ Vadim Kosmos before the film<br>8.58pm - Film </p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Coal House Cafe, Woodberry Wetlands, Nr Manor House, London N16<br>(entrance on New River Path on Woodberry Grove)</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>The Venue</strong><br>In the magical setting of Woodberry Wetlands (along the boardwalk over the reeds at the edge of the lake sits the Coal House Cafe - a pretty brick built cafe serving a selection of wines, beer, soft drinks and a menu of food for you - all profits of food and drink go towards the brilliant work that </p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Why Stand By Me?<br></strong>Rob Reiner\\u2019s moving and gentle (and in parts emotionally tough) tale of growing up in small town America has a brilliant soundtrack and a brilliant cast \\u2026 River Phoenix is truly moving and his premature death adds an extra sad element to an already nostalgic film.</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Based on Stephen King's 1982 novella The Body, the film is set in the fictional town of Castle Rock, Oregon in 1959<br><em>Stand by Me </em>stars Will Wheaton,&nbsp;River Phoenix,&nbsp;Corey Feldman, and&nbsp;Jerry O'Connellas four boys who set out on a journey to find the dead body of a missing boy. </p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>With thanks</strong><br>DJ Vadim Kosmos before the film playing on Audio Gold\\u2019s decks<br>This summer Rebel Reel Cine Club\\u2019s transport is sponsored by Alfa Romeo (Marcello is transporting everything to give Keef a rest!)</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-f7lzf-z257w-7knte-aj3p6-8h2wy\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/521b3247-42f4-427f-a488-036086d82c1b/1.jpg\",\"contentType\":