e/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/2528e55f-3d5c-4c66-b8fb-4cd351eddad1/tempImage15sUhj.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"4032x3024\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6855929b2051373bfcb4ca91\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1718792508901,\"updatedOn\":1723497474301,\"displayIndex\":10,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"6855929b2051373bfcb4ca86\",\"systemDataId\":\"b47aa09e-7e25-4df9-89f3-2254d3c026fb\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"4032x3024,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"tempImagetan5ci.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"1a0e08\",\"topRightAverage\":\"5c4f3d\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"020201\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"372613\",\"centerAverage\":\"17130b\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"30251b\"},\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/b47aa09e-7e25-4df9-89f3-2254d3c026fb/tempImagetan5ci.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"4032x3024\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1614x2048\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"681b3c72187fbe0da1b75a88\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1787981583133,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1746615693913,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"d194f077-035f-4854-a941-cf0264ad767f\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"PARTY GIRL-4.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"59595b\",\"topRightAverage\":\"393417\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"324836\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"383838\",\"centerAverage\":\"302824\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"4c4842\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt\",\"title\":\"PARTY! PARTY GIRL/ HAIL THE NEW PURITAN - Thursday 5th June from 6.00pm - All is Joy, 75 Dean Street, Soho\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Come to PARTY @ All is Joy Soho in the heart of Soho on Dean Street.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">6.00pm: DOORS - Martin Green DJing</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">6.45pm: Introduction by Sue Tilley (author of Leigh Bowery: The Life and Times of an Icon) and Chris McGill (Rebel Reel Cine Club)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">7.05pm: Artist Pavel Anuska Film and images from her canon of work (also showing in studio by bar)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">7.10pm: Hail The New Puritan (1hr 25mins)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">8.35pm: Martin Green DJing</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">8.50pm: Party Girl (1hr 34mins)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">10.25pm: Film Ends, Martin Green DJing until Midnight</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Midnight: Carriages Await!</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Hail The New Puritan</strong><br>Dir. Charles Atlas<br><span>Hail the New Puritan is a </span><strong><em>1986 British fictionalized documentary</em></strong><span> about the Scottish dancer and choreographer Michael Clark.</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>Party Girl</strong><br>Dir: Daisy von Scherler Mayer<br>1995 starring Parker Posey<br><span>A 20-something, irresponsible party girl is bailed out of jail by her librarian godmother. To repay the loan, she starts working at the library and gradually turns her life around.</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">In part<a href=\\\"https://www.google.com/search?client=safari&amp;sca_esv=08585d473c0e2128&amp;rls=en&amp;q=Daisy+von+Scherler+Mayer&amp;si=AMgyJEtRPX4ld4pdQeltMBlsXK6YnLg9be4xryEBJwXFHLOO-DLE2EHGunqIRUOnVM49RBiS8J7nm6hP_Bpm8tctDENPaLYdH7FX6g3D2eFhBWOFae_SRKz_LKlZ1aa7Uhmir6_W26pEEjSDA92QRYoaB5sMvWXEwOr3vbfIPru-2OZf5f5Uxckke9vCENo3LaDV2oL3hqxJY4gC-abYO8I80kUBtrhj3A%3D%3D&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjglePNnMiNAxX-QEEAHbt0Id4QmxN6BAgvEAI\\\">n</a><a href=\\\"https://www.google.com/search?client=safari&amp;sca_esv=08585d473c0e2128&amp;rls=en&amp;q=United+States&amp;stick=H4sIAAAAAAAAAOPgE-LQz9U3KChKrlLiBLEsk83LDbTMs5Ot9NMyc3LBhFVJRmpiSVFmcmKOQnJ-aV5JUaVCfppCflFmemaeQlFqTmpicapCSmJJ6iJW3tC8zJLUFIXgEiC3eAcr4y52Jg4GAHiDutpoAAAA&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjglePNnMiNAxX-QEEAHbt0Id4QmxN6BAgpEAI\\\">ers</a><a href=\\\"https://www.google.com/search?client=safari&amp;sca_esv=08585d473c0e2128&amp;rls=en&amp;q=Daisy+von+Scherler+Mayer&amp;si=AMgyJEtRPX4ld4pdQeltMBlsXK6YnLg9be4xryEBJwXFHLOO-DLE2EHGunqIRUOnVM49RBiS8J7nm6hP_Bpm8tctDENPaLYdH7FX6g3D2eFhBWOFae_SRKz_LKlZ1aa7Uhmir6_W26pEEjSDA92QRYoaB5sMvWXEwOr3vbfIPru-2OZf5f5Uxckke9vCENo3LaDV2oL3hqxJY4gC-abYO8I80kUBtrhj3A%3D%3D&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjglePNnMiNAxX-QEEAHbt0Id4QmxN6BAgvEAI\\\">hip with A Rabbit\\u2019s </a>Foot magazin<a href=\\\"https://www.google.com/search?client=safari&amp;sca_esv=08585d473c0e2128&amp;rls=en&amp;q=Daisy+von+Scherler+Mayer&amp;si=AMgyJEtRPX4ld4pdQeltMBlsXK6YnLg9be4xryEBJwXFHLOO-DLE2EHGunqIRUOnVM49RBiS8J7nm6hP_Bpm8tctDENPaLYdH7FX6g3D2eFhBWOFae_SRKz_LKlZ1aa7Uhmir6_W26pEEjSDA92QRYoaB5sMvWXEwOr3vbfIPru-2OZf5f5Uxckke9vCENo3LaDV2oL3hqxJY4gC-abYO8I80kUBtrhj3A%3D%3D&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjglePNnMiNAxX-QEEAHbt0Id4QmxN6BAgvEAI\\\">e (free copy with every </a>ticket! our friends at A Rabbit\\u2019s Foot are kindly giving us copies of the Jeremy O Harris cover magazine - this is more of a book that a magazine and we love it!)</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Hail The New Puritan - the spoof documentary made by Charles Atlas will be introduced by Sue Tilley (Author of the Leigh Bowery book that inspired the exhibition at Tate Modern) - you can buy the book and have it signed by Sue!</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">DJ Martin Green from 6.00pm and after the film until midnight</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z-cx7wt\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/d194f077-035f-4854-a941-cf0264ad767f/PARTY+GIRL-4.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"52fcc4e0-29e4-4398-b196-d22c4b49ed59\",\"sku\":\"PARTY\",\"price\":1750,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"17.50\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"cu