,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1787965179456,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1742760015603,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"52e3af75-1bc2-4286-862f-405ad5670bfa\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"300x168,100w,300w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"image.jpeg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"d1cab8\",\"topRightAverage\":\"c5c6bb\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"283629\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"29352b\",\"centerAverage\":\"474e46\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"646961\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-49epm-f7lzf-2wlpc-maytx\",\"title\":\"Badlands - Saturday 10 May 2025 - Kelly's Snack Shack, Dungeness Beach\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<h1 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>BADLANDS</strong></h1><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>Directed by</span><strong><span>Terrence Malick</span></strong></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">United States, <span>1973</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><span>A tale of crime and love begins in a dead-end town when teen baton-twirler Holly takes off with older rebel Kit after a conflict with her father erupts in murder. In the ensuing crime spree, they journey through the Midwest to the Badlands of Montana, eluding authorities along the way.Trying to get back to nature, Keith Pratt and h</span><a href=\\\"https://mubi.com/en/cast/mike-leigh\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><span>i</span></a><span>s wife Candice Marie go camping in Dorset. Everything is fine until other campers arrive at the site and start to disregard the country code and shatter the peace and quiet.</span></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=