00w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"SmallWorldofSammyLee.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"471010\",\"topRightAverage\":\"511212\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"202020\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"2b2b2b\",\"centerAverage\":\"beb3ac\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"5a4f48\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z\",\"title\":\"The Small World of Sammy Lee - Thursday 1st May - All is Joy, 75 Dean Street, Soho\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">The Small World of Sammy Lee</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Anthony Newley stars in this slice of Soho titillation and grift!</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Back once again in All is Joy on Dean Street. A stone\\u2019s throw from where we showed our first ever film \\u2026 there\\u2019s so much Soho action in this film \\u2026 </p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">DJ For Mankind from 7pm and after the film playing a suitably laid back Small World of Sammy Lee style soundtrack \\u2026</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj-bzw8t-p574z\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/40e1a4dd-46db-4bad-8fd3-2db15a6edbb7/SmallWorldofSammyLee.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":