w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Untitled (Facebook Video).jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"0a0605\",\"topRightAverage\":\"0a0605\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"060404\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"262009\",\"centerAverage\":\"111008\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"3a2e16\"},\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/480bbbc3-8966-4beb-a245-a42d25812f37/Untitled+%28Facebook+Video%29.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"67e3e193af4ef41c39ffd996\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1741883210922,\"updatedOn\":1741883210922,\"displayIndex\":1,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"67e3e193af4ef41c39ffd98e\",\"systemDataId\":\"61c679a9-10bc-49cf-b285-4c02adbb499f\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"5760x3840,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Cinema - 1.JPG\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"0c0a0d\",\"topRightAverage\":\"0d0d15\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"2f2f45\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"1c1923\",\"centerAverage\":\"212228\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"302e42\"},\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/61c679a9-10bc-49cf-b285-4c02adbb499f/Cinema+-+1.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"5760x3840\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"67e3e193af4ef41c39ffd999\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1741883210917,\"updatedOn\":1741883210917,\"displayIndex\":2,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"67e3e193af4ef41c39ffd98e\",\"systemDataId\":\"42bcb234-6759-4551-94fb-b4982e957714\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"5760x3840,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"Cinema - 2.JPG\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"100c13\",\"topRightAverage\":\"0f0d11\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"282731\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"353248\",\"centerAverage\":\"403647\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"363147\"},\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/42bcb234-6759-4551-94fb-b4982e957714/Cinema+-+2.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"5760x3840\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"67b849592f805c6bc171d9bc\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1787953782887,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\",\"Punk\",\"Washington\",\"Pam Hogg\",\"Scott Crawford\",\"Dave Grohl\",\"Ian MacKaye\",\"Thurston Moore\",\"Henry Rollins\",\"Fred Armisen\",\"Fugazi\",\"Dag Nasty\",\"Slickee Boys\",\"Bad Brains\",\"Big Boys\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1740131432566,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"d00cbfcb-baa4-4eb8-8881-b5d3ed1cfc89\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"INVITATION FOR THE LOOK OF LOVE-4.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"491010\",\"topRightAverage\":\"521c15\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"5d605f\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"ab8c8d\",\"centerAverage\":\"6f3b2a\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"58453d\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj\",\"title\":\"Soho, Filthy London!!! - The Look of Love  - All is Joy, 75 Dean Street, Soho - Friday 21 March 7pm - late\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Join us in the heart of seedy, filthy, shocking Soho \\u2026 celebrating Soho in film and music\\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Martin Green DJing in the bar before the film and DJ For Mankind (Pikes Ibizia, Athens of The North) after the film - come see the film and then have a dance or sway from side to side \\u2026 </p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">The Look of Love<br>Dir. Michael Winterbottom<br>UK, 2013<br>1hr 41mins</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">What better film than Paul Raymond biopic The Look of Love to start our monthly residency in the old Warner Brothers Screening room (with 100 seats, sofas and a bar), right in the heart of Soho. It\\u2019s the fictionalised story of part of Paul Raymond\\u2019s life \\u2026</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">All is Joy is born out of the ashes of Warner Bros De Lane Lea, taking over the historic post sound studio and turning it into the newest underground venue. Hosting independent cinema, music and art, All is Joy is bringing the grassroots back to Soho. With an inclusive members dive bar, cinema and studios.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">From director Michael Winterbottom (24 Hour Party People, Greed) comes the sexy, funny and outrageously true story of Paul Raymond (Steve Coogan), the controversial entrepreneur and property baron who established the Raymond Revue Bar in the 50\\u2019s and went on to become Britain\\u2019s richest man by the early 90\\u2019s. The Look of Love is a real-life tale which focuses on Raymond\\u2019s relationships with the three most important women in his life: his wife Jean (Anna Friel), his lover Fiona (Tamsin Egerton) and his daughter Debbie (Imogen Poots).</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Russ Forman (DJ For Mankind) will be DJing after the film.</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k-wbbrf-zfdft-m3sgj\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/d00cbfcb-baa4-4eb8-8881-b5d3ed1cfc89/INVITATION+FOR+THE+LOOK+OF+LOVE-4.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"45b1fdc2-e7b8-49f5-a135-6a17cfacc9bd\",\"sku\":\"SOHO LONDON\",\"price\":1500,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"15.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\