se,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\",\"Julian Temple\",\"Malcolm McLaren\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1722855712430,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"86f102e6-05c0-45c8-9bd3-ee26ac58c9a7\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"HEAD SOUTH (2).jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"69696a\",\"topRightAverage\":\"555555\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"242110\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"333d3b\",\"centerAverage\":\"6a614f\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"3f4a45\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k\",\"title\":\"Head South - 100 Club, 100 Oxford Street - Sunday 13 October 2024\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Music Film Network presents Head South</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">TIME:&nbsp; 2 pm \\u2013 7 pm</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">TICKETS:&nbsp; \\u00A315.00</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">UK FILM PREMIERE</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">HEAD SOUTH</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: black\\\">Christchurch, New Zealand 1979.&nbsp;Angus, alone for a couple of weeks with his world-weary father, is drawn into the underground post-punk music scene. Desperate to fit in with this magnetic but fickle subculture, Angus distances himself from his true friends and lies about his musical abilities to his new \\u2018friends\\u2019. Caught out by his own deceit he must become the musician he pretended to be. With the support of his friends, especially the talented Kirsten, Angus navigates self-doubt, derision, harmful behaviour and a family tragedy to take the stage for the first time.</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color: black\\\">Trailer:&nbsp; </span><a href=\\\"https://vimeo.com/905631030\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration:underline\\\"><span style=\\\"color: black\\\">https://vimeo.com/905631030</span></span></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">\\u2018sweet-natured entertainment\\u2019. THE GUARDIAN</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33)\\\">&nbsp;+ LIVE MUSIC FROM DESPERATE MEASURES - Christchurch, New Zealand, 80's punks, now reborn and rocking the U.K.</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33)\\\">&amp;</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33)\\\">MARK VENNIS &amp; A DIFFERENT PLACE - </span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(27, 27, 27)\\\">\\u201Cpunk-fueled indie rock</span> <span style=\\\"color: rgb(27, 27, 27)\\\">that's sharp, infectous, and impossible to resist\\u201D&nbsp;</span></p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-352bw-3nstx-g5pwl-5gk3k\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/86f102e6-05c0-45c8-9bd3-ee26ac58c9a7/HEAD+SOUTH+%282%29.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":