\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"dcdabc\",\"topRightAverage\":\"b3b9a1\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"d1cfb8\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"8d9281\",\"centerAverage\":\"776656\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"949281\"},\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/55090a85-5a2c-4d9c-a965-661d3546f4ea/5320_00091.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"4484x3240\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"66d03a94dabba303f3fa2561\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1724922516962,\"updatedOn\":1731768641562,\"displayIndex\":7,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"66c50de8fb477e27db69abf7\",\"systemDataId\":\"7872b5db-2ac4-4969-858e-95cfd57fef8d\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"4484x3240,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"5320_00218.JPG\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"4a5d4e\",\"topRightAverage\":\"3e4044\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"8cb193\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"3e4e49\",\"centerAverage\":\"484640\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"5f6a5d\"},\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/7872b5db-2ac4-4969-858e-95cfd57fef8d/5320_00218.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"4484x3240\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"66b099e2d4fc23194600b814\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1787904346359,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1722851540424,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"4e74a4fc-d7fa-4649-885c-3212373cae7e\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"THE MISFITS.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"020202\",\"topRightAverage\":\"484848\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"232323\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"2a2611\",\"centerAverage\":\"636363\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"646460\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-3s5f7-yap6g-kaesp-ppb44\",\"title\":\"The Misfits - Dungeness Beach - Friday 23 August - Pizza and music from 7pm, Screening at Sunset 8.06pm\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">The Misfits 1961 (Dir. John Huston)</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">At Rebel Reel we love Double Denim and no-one did Double Denim better than Marilyn Monroe! This was her last (and best - she won the 1961 Golden Globe Award for \\u2018World Film Favourite\\u2019 </p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Filmed on a dry lake bed in Nevada, this is why we\\u2019re showing it on Dungeness \\u2026 endless sky and horizons \\u2026 The Misfits was written by Marilyn\\u2019s then husband Arthur Miller as an anti Western Western)</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Marilyn was 34 years old when <em>The Misfits </em>was released, few could have imagined that it would be her cinematic swan song, though Huston later mentioned that\\u2014given her penchant for finding comfort in substances while her marriage to Miller crumbled\\u2014he felt \\u201Cabsolutely certain that she was doomed.\\u201D</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">The Misfits was also the last film for Marilyn\\u2019s co-star and childhood screen idol Clark Gable, who died less than two weeks after filming was completed in November 1960. Few of <em>The Misfits</em>\\u2018 principal cast would survive the decade, with Gable and Monroe followed in death by Montgomery Clift in 1966 and Thelma Ritter in 1969.</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><em>The Misfits</em> begins with Roslyn Tabor (Monroe) seeking to obtain a quickie divorce in Reno, where she meets the grizzled cowboy Gay Langland (Gable), who later introduces her to his rodeo-riding pal Perce Howland (Clift)\\u2026</p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-3s5f7-yap6g-kaesp-ppb44\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/4e74a4fc-d7fa-4649-885c-3212373cae7e/THE+MISFITS.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{},\"optionValues\":[],\"id\":\"09af4717-3a83-46d1-aa2a-b57dde9f35f8\",\"sku\":\"MISFITS\",\"price\":1250,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"12.50\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"productAddOnsConfiguration\":{\"productAddOns\":[]},\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceC