15a46\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"bfa976\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"866b51\",\"centerAverage\":\"6d2f1d\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"bc8973\"},\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/1712921808372-6AEBS9ELII8WHVK5YFGL/7f36a3ca-ee4c-40cc-9469-0c9e9c72d742.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"838x1038\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"271x367\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"66194f49d27e5a7cba811317\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1787884420468,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1712939867415,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-3s5f7\",\"title\":\"Sideways at Westwell Winery, near Ashford, Kent - Saturday 11 May 7pm (film 8.30pm)\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Rebel Reel Cine Club at Westwell Winery, Kent present an evening to celebrate:</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Sideways</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Dir. <a href=\\\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=de06a028fb71868c&amp;sca_upv=1&amp;q=Alexander+Payne&amp;stick=H4sIAAAAAAAAAONgVuLUz9U3MCooi095xGjCLfDyxz1hKe1Ja05eY1Tl4grOyC93zSvJLKkUEudig7J4pbi5ELp4FrHyO-akViTmpaQWKQQkVualAgClFlTbVgAAAA&amp;sa=X&amp;sqi=2&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj0-KX1ir2FAxXi9wIHHdKjBAsQzIcDKAB6BAghEAE\\\">Alexander Payne</a> 2004</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Miles (Paul Giametti) is an unsuccessful novelist and Jack (Thomas Haden Church) an equally unsuccessful actor about to get married.</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Taking a Californian road trip to drink and have one last blast they end up complicating things with Stephanie (Sandra Oh) and Maya (Virginia Madsen).</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Paul Giametti always maintains that scenes were shot drinking real wine \\u2026 What better place to watch it than in a vineyard!</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"><strong>Screening outside (if weather is fair, inside if inclement) </strong></p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"><strong>Drink and music from 7pm</strong></p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"><strong>Music from Adrian Pike on decks from 7pm</strong></p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"><strong>Main Feature 8.30pm</strong></p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"><strong>Food and drinks available - lots of wine BUT NO MERLOT</strong></p><p class=\\\"\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"></p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-3s5f7\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/604e95de63949d1dc619f0de/66194f49d27e5a7cba811317/1787884420468/\",\"contentType\":\"application/octet-stream\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{},\"optionValues\":[],\"id\":\"6ccb139f-62c6-4e73-b19b-ff7f1ab201e3\",\"sku\":\"Sideways\",\"price\":1500,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"cu