RightAverage\":\"ffffff\",\"centerAverage\":\"423f3b\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"918b86\"},\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/null\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/1698233616157-8L771VM67TPV8PCRDZFO/cellar+door+through+the+glass+small.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1500x1500\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"65099b21dd34a03916d51fbc\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1632383201443,\"updatedOn\":1787852351337,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[\"Subculture Screenings\",\"Richard E Grant\",\"Bruce Robinson\",\"Paul McGann\",\"Withnail and I\"],\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1695128445039,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"1701794785585-GIQ5GZZ5IDDL5DO21MYZ\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPEG\",\"filename\":\"The Wickerman Past Event.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"969696\",\"topRightAverage\":\"ffffff\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"767676\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"111111\",\"centerAverage\":\"d0bc9a\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"7d7d75\"},\"urlId\":\"droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-dddzn\",\"title\":\"The Wicker Man INSIDE at Westwell Winery, - Ashford, Kent - Saturday 28th October food from ALKHAM VALLEY Pizza.\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">INSIDE WESTWELL WINERY BAR AND PRESSING ROOM Rebel Reel Cine Club at Westwell Winery, Kent presented an evening to celebrate:</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"><strong>The Wicker Man 1973 Dir. Robin Hardy </strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\">with a screenplay by Anthony Shaffer (<strong><em>Sleuth &amp; Frenzy) </em></strong>and soundtrack by Paul Giovanni.</span></p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">From 6pm, screening at 7pm</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Food was from <strong>ALKHAM VALLEY Pizza </strong></p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Hot wine, cold wine, beers and softs available by the glass or bottle</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">A trip to Summerisle - the seemingly idylic (if a bit sinister) outer hebridean island as we join naive and pent up\\u2026. indeed buttoned up (literally) Sergeant Howie (Edward Woodward) on his search for missing Rowan Morrison \\u2026</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Watch out for naked locals, folk dancing, Britt Ekland and Christopher Lee as Lord Summerisle \\u2026 oh and a brilliant brilliant soundtrack \\u2026</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">FAQs</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Is the screening inside or outside: INSIDE</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Should I bring my own chair? We\\u2019ve got benches - you\\u2019re welcome to bring your own chairs those</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">What drinks will there be? Mulled wine, wine (Westwell of course) by the bottle and glass, beers and soft drinks</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">What food is there? Alkham Valley Pizza will be there serving a range of pizzas</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Are there loos? Yes, inside the shed bar!</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Is there parking? Yep - loads</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">What\\u2019s the address/postcode? <span style=\\\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36)\\\"><strong><em>The Vyneyarde, Westwell Ln, Charing TN27 0BW</em></strong></span></p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Westwell Winery is 10 minutes taxi/ car ride from Ashford (35 mins from Kings Cross St Pancras)</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Ashford Taxis - 01233 888888</p><p class=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Express Cars - 01784 4211111</p><p class=\\\"\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\"></p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/droog-7w73f-hg8bp-y7rkt-3gjsk-f6pe8-dddzn\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/1701794785585-GIQ5GZZ5IDDL5DO21MYZ/The+Wickerman+Past+Event.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"07694b94-90df-4d1a-8845-ae41bb755f01\",\"sku\":\"WICKERWESTWELL\",\"price\":1500,\"salePrice\":1250,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"15.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"12.50\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,