ionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1680182539802,\"updatedOn\":1680553428746,\"displayIndex\":5,\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1680182539802,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"63cd5effbf546769ad29af0a\",\"systemDataId\":\"1680182576512-PUPDN4GYJ4WOATY82367\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"3978x3118,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPG\",\"filename\":\"WI-47rt-Edit-2.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"f9f9f9\",\"topRightAverage\":\"f9f9f9\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"7b7b7b\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"666666\",\"centerAverage\":\"acacac\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"818181\"},\"urlId\":\"j5cmy34u4ndpd1h8gjkrgpdqg0dze7\",\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/j5cmy34u4ndpd1h8gjkrgpdqg0dze7\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/1680182576512-PUPDN4GYJ4WOATY82367/WI-47rt-Edit-2.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"3978x3118\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6458ddae2081051fbd5ffa93\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":2,\"addedOn\":1683545518329,\"updatedOn\":1683545523495,\"displayIndex\":6,\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1683545518329,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"parentId\":\"63cd5effbf546769ad29af0a\",\"systemDataId\":\"1683545519501-HOCBOQ9WZ3HBYMB0ZHCZ\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"PNG\",\"filename\":\"WITHNAIL AND I DUNGENESS PAST EVENT.png\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"0a0a0a\",\"topRightAverage\":\"121212\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"303030\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"141414\",\"centerAverage\":\"415a36\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"363935\"},\"urlId\":\"lp06e4l5o7w6tskjjb2c2ugw8csoxy\",\"title\":\"\",\"body\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/lp06e4l5o7w6tskjjb2c2ugw8csoxy\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/1683545519501-HOCBOQ9WZ3HBYMB0ZHCZ/WITHNAIL+AND+I+DUNGENESS+PAST+EVENT.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"image\"}],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"store-item\"},{\"id\":\"642b35d47f036f0bc6b2d11e\",\"collectionId\":\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0de\",\"recordType\":11,\"addedOn\":1625218302697,\"updatedOn\":1787834007306,\"displayIndex\":0,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"categoryIds\":[\"604e95de63949d1dc619f0f4\"],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1680553578000,\"authorId\":\"5f3bff9c2865d009ade5e427\",\"systemDataId\":\"1683545584364-M4DUWHR10XE2IPLFATSJ\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"PNG\",\"filename\":\"GREAT EXPECTATIONS PAST EVENT.png\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"131313\",\"topRightAverage\":\"242424\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"1c1c1c\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"1c1c1c\",\"centerAverage\":\"684156\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"322d2e\"},\"urlId\":\"dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-cl4rk\",\"title\":\"PAST EVENT - Great Expectations - Saturday 6th May 2023 Kelly's Snack Shack, Dungeness Beach\",\"body\":null,\"excerpt\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\">Screened at 8.15pm (food from 7pm)</p><p class=\\\"\\\">This was an outdoor screening (seating available or bring your camping chairs and wrap up warm!</p><p class=\\\"\\\"><strong>Great Expectations&nbsp;</strong>(1947)</p><p class=\\\"\\\">Dir. David Lean</p><p class=\\\"\\\">1hr 53 mins</p><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\" class=\\\"\\\">\\u201CPip! A young gentleman of great expectations.\\u201D</p><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#202124\\\">The Marshes - \\\"</span>dark, flat, wilderness... intersected with dykes and mounds and gates, with scattered cattle feeding on it\\\"\\u2026</p><p style=\\\"margin-left:40px;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#202124\\\"><strong>Charles Dickens, Great Expectations</strong></span></p><p class=\\\"\\\">\\u201CThe greatest of all the Dickens films.</p><p class=\\\"\\\">Lean brings Dickens' classic set-pieces to life as if he'd been reading over our shoulder: Pip's encounter with the convict Magwitch in the churchyard, Pip's first meeting with the mad Miss Havisham, and the ghoulish atmosphere in the law offices of Mr. Jaggers, whose walls are decorated with the death masks of clients he has lost to the gallows.</p><p class=\\\"\\\">Roger Egbert</p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#3E3B3B\\\">Taking on Charles Dickens\\u2019s classic novel \\u2013 a mix of coming-of-age story, social satire and gothic fable \\u2013 David Lean and his collaborators establish the special credentials of their own medium in the opening reel, covering the orphan Pip\\u2019s fateful meeting with convict Magwitch in a Kent churchyard with a tour de force of moving camerawork, expressionist lighting and knife-edge editing.</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align:start;\\\" class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#3E3B3B\\\">Plucked from the provinces by an allowance from a mystery benefactor, Pip subsequently goes up in the world, but John Mills\\u2019s mild performance as the adult hero is upstaged by vivid supporting turns from Jean Simmons as the Young Estella, Martita Hunt as Miss Havisham and \\u2013 in the first of his five roles for Lean \\u2013 Alec Guinness as Herbert Pocket.</span></p><p class=\\\"\\\">The orphan and the spinster, the marshland and the metropolis: Dickens\\u2019s vivid characters and locales receive the breath of cinematic life in David Lean\\u2019s cherished adaptation.</p><p class=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#3E3B3B\\\">\\u201CA large amount of its visual pleasure is derived from the superlative photography of the Medway Saltings, and a recognition of the mordant beauty of English \\u2018weather\\u2019.\\u201D<br>Richard Winnington, News Chronicle, 1946</span></p><p class=\\\"\\\"><strong>Main Feature 8.30pm</strong></p><p class=\\\"\\\"></p>\",\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":1,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/bookhere/p/dungenessignup-tn58j-8bdl4-lslbh-7mrsw-cl4rk\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f3c03f8f64d4e0519d38d26/1683545584364-M4DUWHR10XE2IPLFATSJ/GREAT+EXPECTATIONS+PAST+EVENT.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"StoreItem\",\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"productType\":3,\"customAddButtonText\":\"Add to Cart\",\"useCustomAddButtonText\":false,\"variants\":[{\"attributes\":{\"Ticket Only\":\"\"},\"optionValues\":[{\"optionName\":\"Ticket Only\",\"value\":\"\"}],\"id\":\"cf12ccb1-19c3-4e06-9a28-24a1ef18607e\",\"sku\":\"GREATEXPECT\",\"price\":1300,\"salePrice\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"13.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"qtyInStock\":0,\"width\":0.0,\"height\":0.0,\"weight\":0.0,\"imageIds\":[],\"mainImageId\":\"642b35d47f036f0bc6b2d126\",\"images\":[],\"len\":0.0}],\"variantOptionOrdering\":[\"Ticket Only\"],\"isSubscribable\":false,\"fulfilledExternally\":false,\"mightHavePaymentPlan\":false},\"priceCents\":0,\"salePriceCents\":0,\"priceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"salePriceMoney\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"value\":\"0.00\"},\"onSale\":f